      🔴 THE NEW LAW. fb421 reported 459 gates green across four devices and eight
      skeptics then found 16 BLOCKER / 20 MAJOR / 20 MINOR, because the gates could
      not fail. On THIS device a skeptic replaced the ENTIRE widening machine —
      procVoices, procTwin, procBlur, procBands, the crowd, the detune, the motion —
      with a fixed 12 ms Haas delay and all six R11 gates stayed green WITH BETTER
      NUMBERS, identical to three decimals on all six Types.

      This binary can be rebuilt with any one mechanism DELETED. Each build is a row
      in MUTATION.md with real before/after numbers:
